@startuml componentes_acceso
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F0F6F1
skinparam componentBorderColor #295442
title PoliMarket · Interfaces proporcionadas y clientes (UML 2.5)
component "ClienteWeb\nJavaScript / navegador" as Web
component "ClienteConsola\nJava 21 / terminal" as CLI
interface "API HTTP\nformulario / JSON" as HTTP
component AdaptadorHTTP as Adapter
Web ..> HTTP : Fetch
CLI ..> HTTP : HttpClient
HTTP -down- Adapter
interface IRRHH
interface IVentas
interface IProveedores
interface IBodega
interface IEntregas
Adapter ..> IRRHH
Adapter ..> IVentas
Adapter ..> IProveedores
Adapter ..> IBodega
Adapter ..> IEntregas
component RecursosHumanos as RH
component Ventas as V
component Proveedores as P
component Bodega as B
component Entregas as E
IRRHH -down- RH
IVentas -down- V
IProveedores -down- P
IBodega -down- B
IEntregas -down- E
note bottom of B
 Círculo con línea: interfaz proporcionada.
 Flecha discontinua: dependencia de uso.
 Contratos Java definidos en Contracts.java.
end note
@enduml

@startuml componentes_negocio
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F0F6F1
skinparam componentBorderColor #295442
title PoliMarket · Colaboración entre componentes (UML 2.5)
component Entregas as E
component Ventas as V
component Proveedores as P
component Bodega as B
component RecursosHumanos as RH
E ..> V : <<use>> IVentas\npendientes / obtener
E ..> B : <<use>> IBodega\nsacar
V ..> B : <<use>> IBodega\nexistencias / reservar
P ..> B : <<use>> IBodega\ningresar
B ..> RH : <<use>> IRRHH\nverificar
V ..> RH : <<use>> IRRHH
P ..> RH : <<use>> IRRHH
E ..> RH : <<use>> IRRHH
note bottom of RH
 Las interfaces se definen en la vista superior.
 Los cinco componentes dependen de Store:
 transacciones y persistencia compartidas.
 Store no se cuenta como área de negocio.
 Inyección por constructor en Server.java.
end note
@enduml
